<newsitem itemid="74907" id="root" date="1996-09-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Specialty lifts half yr shr, distribution.</title>
<headline>Specialty lifts half yr shr, distribution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>				  (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, attrib (cts)</p>
<p>     - including 'N' shares   7.8	 vs     7.2</p>
<p>    Distribution (cts)	  2.0	 vs     1.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     16.73	 vs     13.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     24.19	 vs     21.33</p>
<p>    Tax			    7.46	 vs     7.38</p>
<p>    Finance costs		0.86	 vs     2.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		   599.87	 vs     437.83</p>
<p>Full name: Specialty Stores Ltd (stores)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would award capitalisation shares to shareholders registered on November 1. Shareholders may elect to receive a cash distribution instead.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
